<h3 data-path-to-node="23">6. Build in Flexibility</h3>
<p data-path-to-node="24">Stock rotates and campaigns shift. Use movable partitions, adjustable track lights, and modular rails so your space can adapt quickly without needing a full refit every year. In commercial and <a href="https://www.oraanj-interiors.co.uk/residential-interior-design-london/">luxury residential interior design London</a> environments alike, adaptability protects long-term asset value.</p>

